            "text": "The paired oracle imports three CLI-oriented TypeScript modules as libraries. Their hashbangs are unnecessary under npm/tsx and can leave an unexpected carriage-return token in the Windows Oxc transform path, so this guard keeps those imports hashbang-free.",
